n), `showing` (the clock is on screen now; it appears 15 s after a conversation ends), the hint, the hours and the local time.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"mode":{"type":"string","default":"status"},"start":{"type":"string","default":""},"end":{"type":"string","default":""}}}},{"name":"self.imu.get_state","description":"Motion sensor state of this device: whether it lies face-down (face-down mutes the microphone and announcements), gesture counts since boot, the last gesture (pick_up, face_down, face_up, double_tap) and its age in milliseconds.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{}}}]}}}
